flowchart LR
    ROOT["Target primitive: quantum P plus classical Q on secp256k1"]
    ALG["Algorithm"]
    OPT["Optimization"]
    SHELL["Reversible coordinate shell: subtract Q, times-3 add, Solinas square, reconstruct"]
    DWALK["Divide walk: 750-round signed binary-GCD on (p, Qx - Px), rigid alternation, one sign qubit per round"]
    MWALK["Multiply walk: 750-round signed walk on (p, Px - x3)"]
    TAPE["Sign tape (750 qubits per traversal; 748 live at the peak)"]
    REPLAY["Interleaved coefficient replay: per round one 256-bit chunked Gidney add, boundary carry erases, pseudo-Mersenne fold, flag phase repair"]
    WBACK["Reverse walk: restores denominator, clears tape"]
    OUT["Affine point P plus Q; work state clean"]
    PEAKQ["Peak = tape 748 + coefficient registers 512 + carry ladder 64 + 9 = 1,333 qubits"]
    BUDGET["Calibrated per-draw failure budget ~2.3e-2 (rounds 1.8e-2, chunk 3.2e-3, fold 1.3e-3, flag 3e-4)"]
    CAL["Each window calibrated on the trusted evaluator at small widths; measured 2^-w scaling"]
    K1["Chunk-boundary erase comparator 96 -> 33 bits (27 x 2^(20-k) failures/draw; ~1.2 T/round/bit)"]
    K2["Fold windows 80 -> 68 bits (1,396 x 2^(48-w) failures/draw; ~1.0 T/round/bit)"]
    K3["Flag comparator 56 -> 36 bits (~25 x 2^(20-k) failures/draw; ~0.5 T/round/bit)"]
    ROUNDS["Rounds 790 -> 750: exact walk model, 4.1M fresh shots per traversal, mean 620.6, max 744, tail x0.2 per 10 rounds; 1.8e-2 per draw"]
    ALLOC["Widths set so marginal failure per Toffoli saved is equal across windows"]
    SCHED["Width schedule fitted at 750 rounds: measured per-round need envelope (4.1M shots) + 8-bit margin, never wider than before; -7.0k T"]
    EVAL["Trusted eval: deterministic 102,400-shot draw 0/0/0 plus 2 fresh-seed draws 0/0/0"]
    METRICS["1,333 qubits x 1,025,791 executed Toffoli = 1,367,379,403 (Toffoli depth = count, serial stream)"]

    ROOT --> ALG
    ROOT --> OPT
    ALG --> SHELL
    SHELL --> DWALK
    DWALK --> TAPE
    TAPE --> REPLAY
    REPLAY --> MWALK
    MWALK --> WBACK
    WBACK --> OUT
    TAPE --> PEAKQ
    OPT --> BUDGET
    BUDGET --> CAL
    CAL --> K1
    CAL --> K2
    CAL --> K3
    BUDGET --> ROUNDS
    CAL --> ALLOC
    BUDGET --> SCHED
    SCHED --> DWALK
    SCHED --> MWALK
    K1 --> REPLAY
    K2 --> REPLAY
    K3 --> REPLAY
    ROUNDS --> DWALK
    ROUNDS --> MWALK
    ROUNDS --> PEAKQ
    BUDGET --> EVAL
    EVAL --> METRICS
    PEAKQ --> METRICS
